	<section_number>45.2-805</section_number>
	<catch_line> Underground transformers</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every transformer that is used underground shall be air-cooled or filled with nonflammable liquid or inert gas.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-82.2; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-76; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.183; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
